    {
      "id": 2409,
      "bot_id": "blaster_gs_leader2016",
      "category": "signature",
      "title_zh": "吸收护盾",
      "title_en": "Absorption Shield",
      "desc_zh": "冲击波的屏蔽系统可以升级以吸收传入的能量攻击并修复损坏。他的汽车人同伴也要求对他们的音频接收器进行类似的升级，作为对他音乐品味的回应。\n\n屏蔽时：爆能者的护盾可以让他摆脱基本能量远程攻击的影响，并进一步减少 {{var_13}} 的传入能量伤害。此外，在护盾开启时击中冲击波的能量攻击有 {{var_14}} 几率立即修复冲击波，使对手的攻击评级达到 {{var_15}}。如果攻击是特殊技，他会修复两倍的数量。\n\n+ 每级大约 {{var_16}}",
      "desc_en": "Absorption Shield\nBlaster’s Shielding system can be upgraded to absorb incoming energy attacks and repair damage. A similar upgrade was requested by his fellow Autobots for their audio receptors as an answer to his taste in music.\nWhile Shielded: Blaster’s Shield allows him to shrug off the impact of Basic Energy Ranged Attacks and reduces a further {{var_13}} of incoming Energy Damage. Additionally Energy Attacks that hit Blaster while his Shielding is up have a {{var_14}} chance to instantly Repair Blaster for {{var_15}} of the opponent’s Attack Rating. If the attack is a Special Attack he repairs double that amount instead.\n+ about {{var_16}} per level",
      "pua_icon": "",
